sections.wikitext:
The song was used in the soundtrack of the 2015 [[biopic]] ''[[Eddie the Eagle (film)|Eddie the Eagle]]'', being described by Blake Goble of [[Consequence of Sound]] as "the most on-the-nose use of Van Halen's 'Jump' ever committed to celluloid".<ref>{{cite web|url=https://consequence.net/2016/02/film-review-eddie-the-eagle/|title=Film Review: Eddie the Eagle|first=Blake|last=Goble|website=Consequence of Sound|date=February 25, 2016|access-date=October 24, 2020}}</ref> "Jump" appears in the 2018 science fiction film ''[[Ready Player One (film)|Ready Player One]]''. The song was used in the opening credits of the film and in the trailer for the film,<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.sacurrent.com/sanantonio/steven-spielbergs-ready-player-one-delivers-plenty-of-action-pop-culture-references/Content?oid=10434930|title=Steven Spielberg's Ready Player One Delivers Plenty of Action, Pop Culture References|first=Dan|last=Hudak|date=March 30, 2018|website=San Antonio Current|access-date=October 24, 2020}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.loudersound.com/news/van-halens-jump-used-in-spectacular-ready-player-one-trailer|title=Van Halen's Jump used in spectacular Ready Player One trailer|first=Scott|last=Munro|website=[[Classic Rock (magazine)|Classic Rock]]|date=December 12, 2017|access-date=October 24, 2020}}</ref> and considered an "inspired choice" by Joe Reid of [[Decider.com]].<ref>{{cite web|url=https://decider.com/2018/07/27/weekend-watch-ready-player-one/|title='Ready Player One' Is a Blockbuster That's Perfectly Sized for Home Viewing |website=Decider|date=July 27, 2018|access-date=October 24, 2020}}</ref>

The song was featured by [[McDonald's]], in their [[United Kingdom]] 2023 Christmas television commercial, titled ''Fancy a McDonald's Christmas''.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://blabbermouth.net/news/van-halens-jump-featured-in-christmas-commercial-from-u-k-branch-of-mcdonalds|title=VAN HALEN's 'Jump' Featured In Christmas Commercial From U.K. Branch Of McDonald's|work=Blabbermouth.net|date=November 10, 2023|accessdate=5 July 2024}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.independent.co.uk/tv/lifestyle/mcdonalds-christmas-advert-love-actually-video-b2445255.html|title=McDonald's unveils Love Actually-inspired Christmas advert|first=Lucy|last=Leeson|work=The Independent|date=November 10, 2023|accessdate=5 July 2024}}</ref>

The song is heard in a scene of the 2005 film ''[[Herbie: Fully Loaded]]'' where the titular character competes in a demolition derby.{{cn|date=September 2024}}

sections.text:
The song was used in the soundtrack of the 2015 biopic Eddie the Eagle, being described by Blake Goble of Consequence of Sound as "the most on-the-nose use of Van Halen's 'Jump' ever committed to celluloid". "Jump" appears in the 2018 science fiction film Ready Player One. The song was used in the opening credits of the film and in the trailer for the film, and considered an "inspired choice" by Joe Reid of Decider.com.

The song was featured by McDonald's, in their United Kingdom 2023 Christmas television commercial, titled Fancy a McDonald's Christmas.

The song is heard in a scene of the 2005 film Herbie: Fully Loaded where the titular character competes in a demolition derby.{{cn|date=September 2024}}

